{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2019-11-06 21:30:00', 'title': 'IAC SEES FY 2019 TOTAL IAC ADJ. EBITDA $975 MLN TO $995 MLN', 'text': 'IAC - SEES FY 2019 TOTAL IAC ADJUSTED. EBITDA $975 MILLION TO $995 MILLION.IAC - SEES FY 2019 OPERATING INCOME $580 MILLION TO $620 MILLION.IAC SAYS IN 2019, CO EXPECTS THAT MATCH GROUP WILL GENERATE ABOUT 80% OF CO’S FREE CASH FLOW.IAC SAYS "IN THE FOURTH QUARTER WE ALSO SOLD 4.6 MILLION SHARES OF PINTEREST".IAC, ON PROPOSAL FOR SEPARATION OF MATCH GROUP, SAYS MATCH WOULD RAISE DEBT & PAY CASH DIVIDEND AS ADVANCE DISTRIBUTION TO ALL MATCH SHAREHOLDERS.IAC, ON PROPOSAL FOR SEPARATION OF MATCH, SAYS NEW MATCH WOULD ASSUME CO’S EXCHANGEABLE NOTES & CORRESPONDING HEDGING INSTRUMENTS.IAC, ON PROPOSAL FOR SEPARATION OF MATCH, SAYS PRIOR TO CLOSING, CO MAY SELL NEW MATCH SHARES TO TARGETED THIRD PARTY INVESTORS.IAC, ON PROPOSAL FOR SEPARATION OF MATCH, SAYS ALL CLASS B MATCH SHARES HELD BY CO WOULD BE CONVERTED INTO COMMON SHARES.IAC SAYS ALL OF NEW MATCH’S SHARES WOULD BE ‘SINGLE VOTE’ COMMON SHARES OF SAME CLASS, INCLUDING SHARES IAC SHAREHOLDERS GET IN NEW MATCH.'}